    silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensKleisliApex is The colimit apex produced by the glue^Kl arrow when all ten typed legs are assembled via Kleisli composition. In the Kleisli category Kl(Free(Sigma)), Mittens is the object at the end of the cite-type-glue-profile chain." .

