    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "circuit_corner:5" ;
    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "dunbar_layer:0" ;
    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "paper_kind:urn:silmaril:entity#papers.01_orientation" ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The WitnessAfterKleisliCite is Witness is the second node of the Kleisli pipeline; it is the free-monad-wrapped sort produced by cite^Kl. For the measurement-leg run, Witness instantiates to Witness_measurement: the free term carrying the source key local-mittens-vet-visit-2024-11-01-2026 for the 4.1kg body-mass reading on Mittens. As a Free(Sigma)(Witness) term it carries provenance but no typed sort yet." .

