    silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensEnrichedProfile is The colimit apex whose full Yoneda profile is the product of ten typed hom-sets. The Set-enrichment claim makes this profile explicitly finite and named: Hom(A, Mittens) for each of the ten source sorts, plus Hom(Mittens, B) for each target sort." .

silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_02_enrichment_by_type_information_concrete_anchor_3
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "EnrichmentAnchorMittens" ;
    rdfs:label "EnrichmentAnchorMittensExample" ;
    silm:hasExample "In 'EnrichmentAnchorMittens', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, Mittens occupies the center column of both rows in the enrichment diagram, instantiated as the running cat: Mrs Hendersons silver-furred domestic cat carrying veterinary record 77 (visit 2024-11-01), microchip ID 2018, weighed 4.1kg. Each adjacent typed hom-set Hom_O_01(X, Mittens) and Hom_O_01(Mittens, Y) carries exactly the named typed arrow shown in the figure; each hom-set is small and explicitly enumerated, illustrating the Set-enrichment property.." .

