    rdfs:label "CiteKleisliAnchorSourceKeyExample" ;
    silm:hasExample "In 'CiteKleisliAnchorSourceKey', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The local string key \"mittensVetRecord77\" is the input to the cite Kleisli arrow. cite(mittensVetRecord77) = eta_Witness(mittensVetRecord77) wraps it into the Free(Sigma) monad, producing a single-element witness list. This is the unit embedding of the key into the typed witness object.." .

