    silm:hasExample "In 'CiteKleisliAnchorWitnessRecord', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, Witness_record = eta_Witness(mittensVetRecord77) is the Free(Sigma)-wrapped result of citing the vet record. It carries the verbatim quote from the source file, the line range, and the local key, all packaged as a typed witness in the Kleisli category Kl(Free(Sigma)).." .

