    silm:hasLongDescription "The LocalWitnessNode is LocalWitness is the second node in the R4 four-arrow absorption pipeline. For the running fixture, a GPT-drafted phrase \"Mittens is the colimit of its observable profile\" becomes the local witness object identified by key local-gpt-yoneda-governed-ontology-v100-2026 in src/bibliography/research_appendix.bib after the cite arrow runs. At this point the phrase has provenance but is still untyped: it has no olog sort and contributes no leg to D_Mittens." .

