    silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensAdmittedApex is Mittens is the colimit apex colim(D_Mittens). In the R4 diagram it is the final upper-row node, reachable from GeneratedWitness only through the four-arrow chain cite -> type -> glue. The probe holds because no shortcut exists: the GPT-drafted phrase \"Mittens is the colimit of its observable profile\" cannot become a Mittens-leg without traversing cite, type, and glue. Mittens is the concrete individual (Mrs. Hendersons silver-furred cat with veterinary record 77, microchip ID 2018, weighed 4.1kg on 2024-11-01) and the apex of the typed cocone — not the GPT phrase." .

