    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "ProbeUngatedRenderAnchorMeasurementEvent" ;
    rdfs:label "ProbeUngatedRenderAnchorMeasurementEventExample" ;
    silm:hasExample "In 'ProbeUngatedRenderAnchorMeasurementEvent', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The measurement-event olog node: Mittens weighed at 4.1 kg on 2024-11-01 at the vet visit. This node must be typed and validated (via SHACL shape) before the render functor produces a proof-surface figure. Without it, the figure is an ungated visual artefact.." .

