    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "circuit_corner:3" ;
    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "dunbar_layer:0" ;
    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "paper_kind:urn:silmaril:entity#papers.01_orientation" ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The WitnessAfterIngest is Witness is the second node in the R5 five-arrow publish chain. For the Mittens measurement fixture, the SourcePhrase \"Mittens measured at 4.1kg on 2024-11-01\" becomes the Witness object after ingest assigns provenance (path: vet/MittensVisit2024-11-01.json, lines 12-14). The witness still has no olog sort and no validation gate clearance — it carries the raw 4.1kg reading and date string but no MeasurementEvent2024 typing yet." .

silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_05_probe_ungated_render_concrete_anchor_3
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "ProbeUngatedRenderAnchorTypedClaim" ;
    rdfs:label "ProbeUngatedRenderAnchorTypedClaimExample" ;
    silm:hasExample "In 'ProbeUngatedRenderAnchorTypedClaim', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, TypedClaim is the third node in the R5 pipeline. For the Mittens fixture, the Witness object becomes the typed claim MeasurementEvent2024 carrying source=Mittens, quality=BodyMassQuality, value=4.1, unit=kg, date=2024-11-01. The typed sort enables the validate arrow but does not yet guarantee SHACL-shape compliance — the validate step has not run.." .

