silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_06_probe_sous_totalizing_concrete_anchor_1
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "ProbeSousTotalizingAnchorVetRecord77" ;
    rdfs:label "ProbeSousTotalizingAnchorVetRecord77Example" ;
    silm:hasExample "In 'ProbeSousTotalizingAnchorVetRecord77', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The veterinary record object in O_01 with the \"about\" arrow to Mittens. Sous reads Hom(VetRecord77, Mittens) = {about}. This is the positive case: the arrow exists and sous reports it.." .

