    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "paper_kind:urn:silmaril:entity#papers.01_orientation" ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The VetRecord77 is The veterinary record object in O_01 with the \"about\" arrow to Mittens. Sous reads Hom(VetRecord77, Mittens) = {about}. This is the positive case: the arrow exists and sous reports it. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'VetRecord77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

