silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_06_probe_sous_totalizing_concrete_anchor_2%23mittenscolimitapex
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "ProbeSousTotalizingAnchorMittensApexAddlBaseTopic" ;
    rdfs:label "ProbeSousTotalizingAnchorMittensApexAddlCircuitCorner" ;
    rdfs:label "ProbeSousTotalizingAnchorMittensApexAddlDunbarLayer" ;
    rdfs:label "ProbeSousTotalizingAnchorMittensApexAddlPaperKind" ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.01_orientation.chapters.13_regression_test_suite.sections.06_probe_sous_totalizing.concrete_anchor_2#mittenscolimitapex" ;
    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "base_topic:free monad" ;
    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "circuit_corner:4" ;
    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "dunbar_layer:0" ;
    silm:hasAdditionalAttribute "paper_kind:urn:silmaril:entity#papers.01_orientation" ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensColimitApex is The colimit apex whose incoming and outgoing profile sous reads via Y^in_Mittens and Y^out_Mittens. Sous reads the profile; it does not author new arrows into or out of Mittens. The profile is determined by what exists, not by what sous wishes existed." .

silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_06_probe_sous_totalizing_decomposition_step_1__step_y%5Ein_mittensx_%3D_homx__mittens
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "The incoming profile functor for Mittens: it takes an object X and returns the set of arrows from X into Mittens. This functor tells you which arrows exist from X to Mittens; it does not create new ones." .

silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_06_probe_sous_totalizing_decomposition_step_2__step_reads__hom_set_observation_read_only%3B_creates__olog_write_wr
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Reading a Hom-set is an observation operation: it lists existing arrows. Creating an arrow is an authoring operation: it modifies the olog. The sous position has read-access to Hom-sets; it does not have write-access to the olog." .

silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_06_probe_sous_totalizing_decomposition_step_3__step_joc_%C2%A76_18__hom__a_is_a_read_only_contravariant_profile%3B_it_d
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Joy of Cats §6.18 introduces representable functors as read-only profiles: Hom(-,A) and Hom(A,-) tell you about existing arrows; they do not manufacture new ones. The sous position reads Y^in_Mittens and Y^out_Mittens; it sees only what is there." .

silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_06_probe_sous_totalizing_decomposition_step_4__step_homvetrecord77__mittens_%3D_about%3B_homphotorecord2023__mittens
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "A sous observer reads Hom(VetRecord77, Mittens): one arrow, \"about\". It reports this. Then it reads Hom(PhotoRecord2023, Mittens): empty set. Sous reports: missing arrow. Sous does not create a photo-record arrow. The cheese-igniter clause: an intellect that fills its own gaps claims totalizing mastery." .

silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_06_probe_sous_totalizing_decomposition_step_5__step_if_sous_invents_arrows__the_profile_misrepresents_the_olog%3B_
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "By Yoneda, the profile is determined by what IS there. If sous invented the arrow PhotoRecord2023 -> Mittens to fill a gap, the profile would claim Hom(PhotoRecord2023, Mittens) is non-empty. But the olog has no such arrow. The Yoneda bijection between natural transformations and profile elements would then misrepresent the olog." .

silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_06_probe_sous_totalizing_decomposition_step_6__step_probe_r6_holds
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Sous observes and reports; it does not act as narrator, authority, or gap-filler. The profile-reading law limits sous to reporting what the existing arrows say." .

silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_06_probe_sous_totalizing_olog_box__soustotalizingprober6
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "SousTotalizingProbeR6" .

